{
 "about": "Ace Combat Zero (SLUS-21346): cloud and weather data per campaign mission (branch 0), read from the game by runtime/src/zero_clouds.c (ACZ_DEBUG_CLOUD_DATA=60, one light run per mission via run_test.sh MISSION=n, 2026-10-20). C1 (ps2_cloud_env) is filled live from the same data every frame; this table is the offline reference and the fallback. Metres = game units / 6; colours RGB 0..255 (0x00BBGGRR words).",
 "fields": {
  "c1": "what zero_clouds.c publishes in this mission: base_m/top_m = P10/P90 of Y -/+ 0.675 height over the list; coverage = 1 - exp(-sum(pi (0.675 radius)^2 opacity) / 21845^2), opacity averaged over the coverage map copies (coverage_unmasked without the map); type 0 stratus .. 1 cumulus from the median S / 8.85 (1000 m -> 0, 350 m -> 1); transp = 0 (the game alpha only raises the drop threshold); precip_max = max of the set halves A/B (the live value is sky +0xB8C); sun_dir = world unit vector (y up) from the elevation/azimuth",
  "clouds": "type_word = env +0x190 (bit 1 cloud field, bit 0x100 two impostor variants); count = u16 +0x200 (count_hi = its upper u16, unknown); alpha = +0x1FC (128 opaque); wind = +0x1A0/+0x1A4 (units/s) / 6; desc_08_m = +0x198 / 6 (meaning unknown); variant_y_m = [base, spread (half range), size scale] per variant; centre_m, sprite_m (the game sprite half-size S = size x 2304 x scale / 206.6 units), radius_m (visible body, horizontal semi-axis 0.667 S x build_width_fw), height_m (vertical semi-axis 0.262 S) = P10/P50/P90 over the list; band_m = the c1 band; coverage_unmasked ignores the coverage map; map_mean / map_used: the coverage map (mean, fraction of 4x4-cell blocks above 0)",
  "precip": "amount = env +0xD4 / +0x174 (set halves A / B, blended by sky +0xB30), kind_value +0xD8 / +0x178 (>= 0.5 snow), band_m = sky +0x10/+0x14: precipitation is full below the band and fades to 0 at its top",
  "sun": "elevation/azimuth = env +0x58/+0x5C (file offsets; second_pair +0x88/+0x8C); dir = (-cos e sin a, sin e, -cos e cos a)",
  "fog_m": "env +0x50/+0x54 (A) and +0xF0/+0xF4 (B) / 6: fog near / far",
  "run": "camera altitude range and the blend/precipitation values seen in the probe run (not mission data)",
  "earlier_sets": "environment sets active before the flight one (intro / take-off sub-stage)"
 },
